---
title: "ST-01 Job Lifecycle (UML State Machine Diagram)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> waiting: created, has unfinished needs
  [*] --> queued: created, no needs
  [*] --> manual: created, when manual
  waiting --> queued: needs finished [condition true]
  waiting --> skipped: needs finished [condition false]
  waiting --> cancelled: run cancelled
  manual --> queued: user clicks Run
  manual --> cancelled: run cancelled
  queued --> running: runner claims (CAS)
  queued --> cancelled: run cancelled
  running --> success: exit code 0
  running --> failure: exit code non-zero / timeout / runner lost
  running --> cancelling: user cancels
  cancelling --> cancelled: runner confirms / 60 s elapsed
  failure --> queued: retry [attempt less than retry + 1]
  success --> [*]
  failure --> [*]
  skipped --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
